OL,3,GNEWSAMemorial match for dad who was hit
OL,4,Aby car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA football match is set to take place
OL,7,Fin memory of Tommy Hunter, who died
OL,8,Ffrom a head injury after being hit by a
OL,9,Fcar while walking home from a night
OL,10,Fout.
OL,12,FThe match will kick off at 10:30 BST on
OL,13,FSunday at the Hawfields Ground in
OL,14,FNewhall, Derbyshire, and will feature a
OL,15,Fhalf-time show from Hunter's son and
OL,16,Fother members of his team at Fight
OL,17,FStation Kickboxing.
OL,19,FIn a post online, Fight Station said:
OL,20,F"This is a day to come together as a
OL,21,Fcommunity to celebrate the life,
OL,22,Ffriendship and legacy of Tommy Hunter."
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
